    {
      "id": "noh-cartesian-2d",
      "title": {
        "ja": "Noh問題：実際の2次元Cartesian Euler計算",
        "en": "Noh problem: an actual 2D Cartesian Euler calculation"
      },
      "group": "noh-cartesian",
      "problem_id": "noh",
      "summary": {
        "ja": "正方形の全域で密度・2成分運動量・全エネルギーを更新する、小型の2次元Euler有限体積計算です。32²・64²・128²の3格子で厳密Noh状態からの誤差・保存収支・格子方向の影響を測ります。図は実際の2次元保存配列で、1D半径解の回転表示ではありません。",
        "en": "A small 2D Euler finite-volume calculation evolves density, both momenta and total energy over the full square. Three grids,32²/64²/128², measure Noh-reference errors, budgets and grid orientation effects. The picture shows the actual evolved 2D array."
      },
      "limits": {
        "ja": "空間一次の軽量例で、原点過熱と衝撃層の誤差が残ります。最細格子でも中心最大比内部エネルギーは厳密値より約14%高いままです。軸・対角の衝撃半径差は約.501Δxで、3格子間で単調には減りません。D4偶奇性が丸め誤差でも円対称性が厳密という意味ではありません。一般の摂動安定性・原点位置ずらし・回転格子・3D Cartesian・高次精度は未検証です。旧1D平面/円筒/球の配布版と判定は変更しません。",
        "en": "A first-order-space lightweight example retains origin heating and shock errors. Finest maximum center specific internal energy is still about 14% high. Axis/diagonal shock-radius difference is about .501dx and is not monotone over these grids. Roundoff-level D4 parity does not establish exact circular symmetry. General perturbation stability, displaced origins, rotated meshes, 3D Cartesian flow and high-order accuracy are unverified. Earlier planar/cylindrical/spherical 1D editions and gates remain unchanged."
      },
      "reading": {
        "ja": "/numerical-methods-atlas/ja/read/validation-noh-cartesian/#noh-cartesian-2d",
        "en": "/numerical-methods-atlas/en/read/validation-noh-cartesian/#noh-cartesian-2d"
      },
